# Public frontend configuration only. Never put client_secret or TikTok tokens here.
# Default browser preview skips login and never fabricates a session.
VITE_API_MODE=mock
VITE_API_BASE=/api/v1
# When platform and backend are ready, live enables the page's login gate.
# Live includes catalog, subscriptions, profile, wallet, history and viewing progress.
# VITE_API_MODE=live
# VITE_API_BASE=https://sailreels.sailson.com/api/v1
# Ad units are created PER APP in the Dev Portal. These override the defaults in
# src/minis/ad-config.ts at build time; blank uses the in-code default.
# NEVER paste another app's IDs (e.g. the old ZorvTales ones): impressions would bill to the wrong
# application and the SDK would reject them.
# rewarded: SailReels' own activated unit (defaults to ad7000000000000000001 in code).
# interstitial: not created yet — leave blank until SailReels has its own interstitial unit.
VITE_REWARDED_AD_UNIT_ID=
VITE_INTERSTITIAL_AD_UNIT_ID=
